===== 3. Parámetro estático: ORA-02095 esperado =====
ALTER SYSTEM SET db_files = 300 SCOPE = MEMORY
                 *
ERROR at line 1:
ORA-02095: specified initialization parameter cannot be modified
Help: https://docs.oracle.com/error-help/db/ora-02095/


-- Escribirlo en SPFILE, pendiente del próximo arranque

NAME		 EN_MEMORIA   EN_SPFILE
---------------- ------------ ----------------
db_files	 200	      300
-- Deshacer con RESET

NAME		 EN_MEMORIA   EN_SPFILE
---------------- ------------ ----------------
db_files	 200	      (no especificado
			      )


===== 4. Dos casos que el examen adora =====
-- PROCESSES es estático: error esperado al cambiar MEMORY
ALTER SYSTEM SET processes = 250 SCOPE = MEMORY
*
ERROR at line 1:
ORA-02097: parameter cannot be modified because specified value is invalid
ORA-02095: specified initialization parameter cannot be modified
Help: https://docs.oracle.com/error-help/db/ora-02097/


-- MEMORY_SIZE puede devolver ORA-62352 si no se fijó al arrancar
ALTER SYSTEM SET memory_size = 1600M SCOPE = MEMORY
*
ERROR at line 1:
ORA-02097: parameter cannot be modified because specified value is invalid
ORA-62352: cannot dynamically set MEMORY_SIZE if not set at startup
Help: https://docs.oracle.com/error-help/db/ora-02097/



